MODIFIED APACHE-2.0 LINEAGE
===========================

CelloCut: Constructive Watertight Remeshing via Tetrahedral Cell Cuts
Official repository: https://github.com/rangeryx-66/CelloCut
Authors: Xuan Yang, Yuhang Zeng, Dinglong Fang, Guochuan Tang, Jiaju Jiang,
Ben Li, Wei Zhou, Xiao-Xiao Long, Cheng Lin.
License: Apache License 2.0.

WTiVo preserves/derives the tetrahedral cell-cut formulation, fill-aware graph
energy semantics, topology/face ordering behavior, and portions of the native
execution structure. Modified WTiVo files are prominently marked. WTiVo changes
the proxy representation, graph execution, memory lifecycle, sparse field path,
and final contour topology repair.

FaithC: Faithful Contouring
Official repository: https://github.com/Luo-Yihao/FaithC
Copyright notice in upstream license: Copyright 2024 Yihao Luo
License: Apache License 2.0.

WTiVo's contour path uses FaithC/FCT/QEF-inspired anchor/normal/quad decoding
and manifold-contouring concepts. The WTiVo implementation is modified for the
sparse OpenVDB + tetra-cell-cut production pipeline.

